        }
      }
    },
    "Imports move files out of the client, so torrents stop seeding on import. Switch to hardlinks to keep seeding.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les imports déplacent les fichiers hors du client, donc les torrents cessent le partage dès l’import. Passez aux liens physiques pour continuer le partage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After import, Rawkoon keeps each torrent seeding until it reaches its ratio, then removes it from the client. Your library copy is a hardlink, so it stays in place.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après l’import, Rawkoon garde chaque torrent en partage jusqu’à ce qu’il atteigne son ratio, puis le retire du client. La copie de votre bibliothèque est un lien physique, elle reste donc en place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops seeding on import. Nothing is seeded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le partage cesse dès l’import. Rien n’est partagé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops seeding once ratio %@ is reached.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le partage cesse une fois le ratio %@ atteint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops seeding after %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le partage cesse après %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops seeding at ratio %@ or after %@, whichever comes first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le partage cesse au ratio %@ ou après %@, selon ce qui arrive en premier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the torrent for %@ from the download client and deletes the old file, so it stops seeding. The re-encoded copy in your library is not touched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceci retire le torrent de %@ du client de téléchargement et supprime l’ancien fichier, donc il cesse d’être partagé. La copie réencodée de votre bibliothèque n’est pas touchée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
